$\frac{d y}{d x}=(x-y)^2\begin{array}{ll}\text { Put } & x-y=t \\ \Rightarrow & 1-\frac{d y}{d x}=\frac{d t}{d x} \\ \Rightarrow & \frac{d y}{d x}=1-\frac{d t}{d x}\end{array}
